[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 29662.948, "timestamp": "08:14:22", "text": "。  好的。祝你一切順利。那麼，大家晚安。  再見。突襲。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29671.59, "timestamp": "08:14:31", "text": "我該去突襲嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29677.75, "timestamp": "08:14:37", "text": "。糟糕，Joy"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29693.31, "timestamp": "08:14:53", "text": "直播了。你好呀。哈希，你遲到了。沒關係。最後一晚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29698.948, "timestamp": "08:14:58", "text": "呃，因為呃，今天是呃30號。今天是5月"}]